# TITLE: IP & DNS Checkers
# DESCRIPTION: Popular IP/DNS/WebRTC/fingerprint checkers for proxy/VPN testing (Shadowrocket / Surge RULE-SET format)
# UPDATED: 2026-11-04
# REPO: add-your-github-here
#
# Usage in Shadowrocket:
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/<user>/<repo>/main/ip-checkers.list,<GROUP>
# Place this rule ABOVE your GEOIP/RU rules so test pages never get hijacked by geo-routing.

